            <ArticleTitle>High-resolution CT of peripheral airways diseases.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>21-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Bronchiolitis and bronchiolectasis are nonspecific inflammatory processes of the small airways that have a variable, but often characteristic, appearance on HRCT. Familiarity with the imaging features of these disorders is crucial in rendering an accurate radiographic diagnosis.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
